<br/>
It is no longer possible to order an &zwnj;iPhone Duo&zwnj; for delivery in 2026 from Apple, and customers who purchase now will be waiting until early 2027. Prior to pre-orders launching, rumors said supplies could be constrained due to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/29/iphone-duo-reportedly-facing-production-problems/">manufacturing difficulties</a>.<br/>
<br/>
